.Background()/TODO(), ...)` regressions.\n- **Test helper:** new `cmd/entire/cli/logging/loggingtest` subpackage for buffer-backed loggers in tests.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `mise run check` (fmt + lint + test:ci, including Vogon canary)\n- [x] `mise run lint` clean with new forbidigo rule\n- [x] All 52 Vogon E2E tests passing\n- [x] `grep` verification: no `logging.Init/Close/SetLogLevelGetter` callers, no globals in `logging/logger.go`, no `hookLogCleanup`\n- [ ] Manual smoke: hooks write `session_id`/`component`/`agent` attrs to `.entire/logs/entire.log`\n- [ ] Manual smoke: `entire --version` outside a repo creates no log file\n\n## Stats\n\n29 files changed, 762 insertions(+), 1449 deletions(-) — net **−687 LOC**.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\" 2>&1 | tail -10","description":"Create draft PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":356,"cache_read_input_tokens":384602,"output_tokens":1160,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":356,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":384602,"cache_creation_input_tokens":356,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":356},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CaWSaVgdM1VtmY8Pn8uB8","type":"assistant","uuid":"68e9f815-8941-403a-8913-664ab52d4453","timestamp":"2026-04-28T15:56:02.949Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gtrrz-victor/wks/cli/add-auto-aupdate","sessionId":"754e21db-63c9-4876-b824-ee99608ee240","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"logging-context-injection","slug":"i-do-think-that-parallel-metcalfe"}
